      },
      "message": "feat(process): refresh a conflicting PR only at merge time; merge-plan planner\n\nA conflicting PR is refreshed only when a merge batch is about to merge\nit, never at session start. `cargo xtask merge-plan` orders a set of PRs\nin waves (wave 1 merges with no refresh, wave 2 one refresh at a time),\nand `--delta` classifies what changed since a reviewed head: a clean\nmerge of main keeps its review. Review markers and merge-ready count only\nfrom the owner's account. One batch gate per merge batch.\n\nPROCESS_VERSION 31.\n\nFixes #1221\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
