      "message": "build(process): fix round - octopus merges, GitHub mergeable, ready flag, owner repo\n\nOctopus merges of main are NEW CODE. GitHub's mergeable decides a\ngit-clean PR too (plain refresh in wave 2). The ready flag after a\nmerge-time refresh is set by the merging session right before the merge.\nThe owner lookup names the base repository. Scratch refs are deleted.\n\nFixes #1221\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
